				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "888b4238-a826-4e39-ad8f-23990ca09fe8")
	)
	(text "ADIN status LEDs (D25): D8 red = ADIN powered (ADIN_VDDIO on).\nD9 / D10 yellow-green = port 1 / port 2 link/activity, ADIN pins 21 / 48, active low.\nOff until the Pi enables each port's LED_1 over SPI; port 2 is also asleep until woken.\nR3 / R5 keep the TX2P4_EN straps high (1.0 V p-p). Cut JP2 to disable all three LEDs."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 285.75 228.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9d3e7fdb-e684-4cab-9f97-c24b2415ed3e")
	)
	(text "SPI_CFG1 (pin19) defaults \"1\"\ncut trace and solder bridge to get \"0\""
